message: "If you use this proof or the verification scripts, cite this archived version and the cited source construction."
title: "Dempwolff's partial-spread extension problem"
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Zhang
    given-names: Yongxian
    orcid: "https://orcid.org/0009-0000-3864-3536"
version: 1.0.0
date-released: 2026-11-27
repository-code: "https://github.com/mxym/math"
abstract: "An exact characterization of spread-preserving extensions for the semibent family of Dempwolff's Theorem 3.5, with a short analytic impossibility proof and independent verification scripts. The result does not preclude unrestricted bent extensions of the associated Boolean functions."
